        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">undefined\n\n# Included processes\nThis data set accounts for 1 kg of XPS at the regional storage. 45% are from import, 55% are produced in Switzerland. The imported share is weighted with a factor of 1.1. The average transport distance is 700 km. 6% are delievered by freight train, 92% by lorry and 2% by barge. Packaging material added according to dataset rock wool, packed, at plant/kg/CH, disposal of packaging material included.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
